<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">EN_ULT en_English_ltr Fri Feb 21 2020 15:46:04 GMT-0500 (EST) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Philippime</para>
  <para style="toc1">Paul ne Philippime dage raukegai laisiu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Philippime</para>
  <para style="toc3">Php.</para>
  <para style="mt">Philippians</para>
  <para style="mt">Paul ne Philippime dage raukegai laisiu</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Philippime, Colossime, Philemon, nah Ephesame de si eh Paul AD 60 tingdau pa Rome ga hebaangki gade laisiu aide raugai. Philippime mapeu si eh Epaphroditus de langpwa Paul dage kai. Epaphroditus Rome ga kebamdau, pa ma teeidi nah Philippi Khristianme pe ziemne penui lung kehereidi. Pa yi luge, Paul laisiu aide si eh pecu Philippi gage langgai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Laisiu aika Paul Philippime de hungsüt kecu nah pa ngqwame dage raukegai laisiu kakgade laisiu aide Paul ziemne mlangsüt kecu ngaulu. Paul Philippime keku nah ngha kegaine kenggai sam ranggai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul au laisiu aide hebaangki gade raugai liede suiyi le puibam. Samkie “suiyi” mede “misuikeyi” pia kereiemdai raugai. Paul pe teilung ha rau eh pa cu dainzwa eh lungh bambi kecu aide raugai, “A ziemne au, lungh bam kera au Khrista ziemne nah tsaidi eh liede kemmi lie” (1:21).</para>
  <para style="ip">Pe laisiu kedadung ga nzwa Paul helung taukemla nah mide ngngwayi eh kelungh nah Tinggwang samzai tei eh kelungh keledeu samdung peugai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Keraisam (1:1-11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul lungneidung (1:12-30)</para>
  <para style="io1">Khrista henah eh kelungh kereli (2:1-18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul samgwamedung (2:19-30)</para>
  <para style="io1">Rangmriak kegai nah keledeu (3:1-4:20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kekambe (4:21-23)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="s">Keraisam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Paul penai Timothy, Khrista Jisu kilabe kena ne—Khrista Jisu gade kemcimedung pelane Philippi namdi ga ngqwa muiteume nah deaconme dage kekai. <verse eid="PHP 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Anui pei Tinggwang nah Rampaube Jisu Khrista dade kegwang ngaugia nah lungciepbe de peu nnuida bam kelube tei lulo.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kenggai sam nah kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Ih nnuide kensung ramsang, a Tinggwang de twabam muila, <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />a kekie leune ga nnui pelane ziemne, a sui yi eh kie muila, <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />kedanemene nnui raitu benai gade cu kecang samliakeyi ta ketei ga acu ngha kelane. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Nah Ih ma aidungde cisiakte bam, nnuida bata keyi ndeu kegaibe de Jisu Khrista cailigwang kera tingba benai kecang tei jüja teicang beuzie. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Ainzwa eh Ih nnui pelane ha cetkela au a ziemne petau, kedanemene nnui au a lung ga bam kelane. Ih hebaang ketei nah samliakeyi de gum nah rangmcilia kegai ga nnui pelane acu ngngwa ngaugia ga ncüt kelume. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Kedanemene Ih Khrista Jisu keku de teu nnui pelane de dai kenzwa gede reguibam labi kecu Tinggwang au a zierangbe da. <verse eid="PHP 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Cine a kekie au aide da: maci nah macet pelane ga nnui keku de peu kieesi reureu lu kera, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />iciu eh peu nnuide yitube kedetlu kera, nah Khrista cailikegwang tingba benai samsang nah kemau gah eh bamlu kerane, <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Jisu Khrista dade kegwang makesang le kepui tei eh Tinggwang de twa nah tei ndulu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 15:8">Isa. 15:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista ha paukelu ga Paul suiyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Cu Ih peu nnuide ci neula, sinamedung, cide a dage teigai kedidung dene samliakeyi de rangmdi si luda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:9">2 Tim. 2:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Cide ziemne, Ih Khrista ziemne hebaang tei lalie kecu Romme gwangpei ki kekwame nah kedamedung pelane da ci gwang dida. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Kedanemene Ih hebaangki ga kebamde ne sinamedung kekiee gede Rampaube gade teingkuu si luda, nah penui ngngi mene kuuki eh Tinggwang sam ranglu kera bam dida. <verse eid="PHP 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Midungge au mide ngau penui riak nah kengaurau eh Khrista ha rangbam, dede kedame au lungsang gade.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:3">Php. 2:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Kekambe maade keku gade cide tei bamla, acu samliakeyi de gumlu kera ziemne aikage kaipwa kebam ci eh. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Dede keraibe maade lungsang gade mene penui ziu cet eh Khrista ha rangla, acu peu hebaang tei eh keherei lu kerane. <verse eid="PHP 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Dai ah sui? Keheibe gade liede, lungcet kemau gade mede petaube gade liede, Khrista ha rangbam dida, nah Ih aide ga a suiyi. Nah Ih a suiyi lazie, <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />kedanemene nnui kekie gade nah Jisu Khrista Rabe kengha aide gade acu lungmpet beuzie kecu Ih cibam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:28">Rom. 8:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Ih luu neusüt nah keregui kebam de au Ih madaude ngngam dilak lie kecu deda, dede pelane gade cude, ndaa nzwa, kuusüt eh a pumteih gade Khrista de hetwa peulu kera deda, kering gade liede mede ketsai gade liede. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />A ziemne au, lungh bam kera au Khrista ziemne, nah tsaidi eh liede kemmi lie. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Dede Ih pumteihbe gade ring lazie liecai, cide a ziemne petsi builukera ta teilu kera da. Dede Ih daide kedet ziebi Ih cisiakte meda. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Acu kena kakgage niagim pwabam dida. A lungning au tetdi neu nah Khrista de ngngwa ladi kerade, cide au yiki kesang kecune, <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />dede nnui ziemne pumteihbe ga bamsi mai siaki bam reu. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Aide cetlu eh Ih nnui pelane de ngngwa bamsi kera Ih cibam, nnui kenlum ga peu yisi nah nnui sui yilu kerane, <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />iciu eh Ih nnuida gwangdai kecudau peu Khrista Jisu gade nnui a ziemne hegie kieeki lu kerane. <verse eid="PHP 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Dede nnui teilung zaide Khrista samliakeyi de luulu kebui gage lungh gai lulo, ciude Ih nnuida gwang kerengau liede mede bam kemakdau liede, nnui rabe gade ket tei eh sap ntip kebam, ngngwa lungge tei eh samliakeyi kenlum ziemne renia eh tetla kecu Ih nnui ha siulu kerane, <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />nah kehei gade de nnui ngauraumedung de hing so. Aide au penui ziemne penuide ngkapdi kera, dede nnuide kelilu kera marehi ge, nah aide Tinggwang dade gwang. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Kedanemene nnuide Khrista ziemne pecu nlumkelu rünne ma, dede peu pe ziemne keherei si kera peu pwabam, <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />kedanemene nnui a rei kengau de nah cu siu kebam de nzwa rei kebamne.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s">Khrista henahbai kecude kereli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Ciziemne, Khrista gade mide kecunglu kela, milung tau mlalu kela keku, Kemci Rabe gade ngngwa kekangbau kecu, mide keku nah kenggia kecu bam liecai, <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />iciucai nnui ngngwa lungge, keku ge, rabe gade ngngwa ket tei nah kelungzwa eh a suiyi teicang gailo. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Nnui ziu ci mede ngang eh magede teiso, dede henah eh kedame nswa yiki lie cetlu. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Keheibede de nnuikatei nnui suibe rünne teiso, dede mikedame suibe de tei lulo. <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Khrista Jisu da kela zaireli de peu nnui dade la lulo,<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />pa au Tinggwang rehi nzwa liede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:6">Tinggwang de ngngwa nsamlie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:6">süt kera cetma.<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Meliene, pa pekatei pecu tei mtaklu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">kilame ge nzwa eh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">pa mina nzwa lungh gwang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">nah mina rehi nzwa miakngau tei gwang,<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />pa pekatei pecu tei henah delwe ketsai kecang de samzai tei gwang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:8">nah cross gade ketsai kecang de!<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Ciziemne Tinggwang de pecu tei ndu sütbeu nah</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:9">pecu hezi keheibe swade diki kecu zi peu.<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />Cine Jisu zi gade tinggim ga kelame, kideu ga kelame nah kideu kangga kelame pelane</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:10">koktung mie zie,<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />nah keheibe de Jisu Khrista au Rampaube lie rang zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:11">Peibe Tinggwang kendu ziemne.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hegi nzwa kebaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Cine, a kumedung, nnui samzai teimui kela nzwa, Ih kebam dau rünne mene, Ih bam kemakdau au mtingki maisia. Ngngi nah mbeu eh nnuide kelikelu ta tei canglu. <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />Kedanemene Tinggwang peu nnuide pe lungningbe tei neu nah peu tei kerane nnuida peta tei bamlu. <verse eid="PHP 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Ma pelane ncam mede kesamlim mene teilu, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />iciude nnui mzui nah mci nah kemau gah eh Tinggwang name tei eh kengkoi nah kemaume ceheu kakga lunghlu kerane, penui kakga nnui kideu kebaabe nzwa baalu, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />kering sambe kerak teu eh, iciude Khrista tingba benai Ih kemta gage laikai tei mede bata kemta ge teidi kemakne Ih hegie luzie. <verse eid="PHP 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Iciude nnui kenlum reca nah ratak bam gage reca ge tei eh acu ruigai liede, Ih au a suiyi bam nah nnui pelane de ngngwa a suiyi nsam bam. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Cinzwa eh nnuide nnui sui yilu nah acu ngngwa nnui sui yilu.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Timothy penai Epaphroditus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Ih Rampaube Jisu lungning liecai Timothy de nnui dage lang kelwa gai kera regui bam, iciu eh Ih nnui ha cilu eh acude kecung silu kerane. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Ih nnui ziemne migede pa kenzwame helungnei kesang kelame gahlu. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Kedanemene penui pelane Jisu Khrista gudung be mene, penui ziuyidung rünne peeila. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Dede nnui pe keyi cibam, kedanemene pe na pe peide ngngwa kela nzwa, pa acu ngngwa samliakeyi dega heta tei. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Ciziemne, a ziemne dainzwa gwangzie bi kecu Ih cilu herizi pecu nnui dage langgai kera Ih regui bam. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Nah Ih de Rampaube gade de nnuida kelwa gwanglu kera Ih nlum bam. <verse eid="PHP 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Epaphroditus, a sinabe acu ngngwa bata tei kelabe, nah acu ngngwa reugwa tei kelabe, nah nnui samgwabe acu ngha kelame de Ih nnui dage langgai maikesia cetlu, <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />kedanemene pa nnui pelane da gwangneu bam dida nah nnui pa nra kebam siu kelune pa pelung keherei bam dida. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Kedanemene pa nra süt eh tsai nage da. Dede Tinggwang pecu ngaunggia beu, nah pecu rünne mene acude, iciu eh Ih alung keherei kecu reude keherei melu kerane. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Ciziemne Ih nnui dage pecu langgai neuki bam, iciu eh nnui pecu ngaudai lude nnui sui yilu kerane, nah a lungrei tei ncam dilu kerane. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Cine nnui sui yisüt eh Rampaube gade pecu ngngwalu delwe pa kenzwa mede herüt peulo. <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />Kedanemene pa nnui a dage teigai kelak ta tei eh Khrista gwa ketei ziemne pe teilung kerehim gage kailwe tsaidi nage delu.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s">Pumteih de nlumgai lak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Kekambe, a sinamedung, Rampaube gade nnui sui yilu. Ma aidungde nnui dage raugaidai kera au a ziemne magede kenang gah, nah nnui ziemne kwakki lu kera ge. <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Heteu kenzwame dade mriaklu, heta kesia teikelame dade mriaklu, miteih dang kelamedung dade mriaklu. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Kedanemene anui au anui hegeurum kelume da, Tinggwang Rabe gade reca kelame, nah Khrista Jisu gade hegie la, nah pumteihbe ga kenlum gah. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Iciu liede, Ih akatei a pumteihbe dede nlum lubui. Mi kedame ge pa pumteihbe ga kenlum lalie cet lacai, Ih nlum kieeki lu kebui bam. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Acu mna kelucai, lang hesetne benai a geu rumlu, Israelme ge, Benjamin leuhme, Hebrewme ne mna kelu Hebrewme ge; Jewme hezaibe lamde cai, Phariseeme ge, <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />siering lamde cai, ngqwabe de teikeherei kecume ge; hezaibe kangga kesamsang lamde cai, mmau gailakme ge. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Dede makeheibe a ziemne kemmi ge lie keladungde, Ih Khrista ziemne cidungde kemta gelie la dida. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Dede kesangbe au, cu Ih ma pelane de kemta lie la dida, kedanemene a Rampaube Khrista Jisu de cikelu pe keyi bamki kecune. Pe ziemne Ih ma pelane püt dida, nah Ih cidungde kemta lie la dida, iciu eh Ih Khrista de ngaulu kerane <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />nah pecu ngngwa ket teilu kerane, hezaibe gade akatei a masang kebamde be mene, dede Khrista de kenlum gade—Tinggwang dade nah kenlum gade kegwang masangde bam dida. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Iciu eh Ih pecu nah pa ringcuh daikelu kengkieng de cilu kerane nah pe reidung ga ncütlwe pa nzwa tsailu kerane, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />iciu eh teilu buicai Ih de ketsai gade ringcuh daikelu ngaulu kerane.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakegai ga gwakegwang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Ih ma aidungde ngau lu, mede Ih yicang dida de kecube ma, dede Ih de cide pwa agu teilu kera ziemne gwa sui jüja gwangla, kedanemene Khrista Jisu acu pwa pegu teilu delu. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Sinamedung, Ih cide pwa agu teilu delie cetla mereu. Dede Ih mage teila: a caile kebamde nsungtadi eh a dwale kebambe gage tet gaila, <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Ih kakegai de gage tet gaila, iciu eh Khrista Jisu gade Tinggwang nreule ge qukegai ziehi de ngaulu kerane. <verse eid="PHP 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Ciziemne anui pelane ngkieng kedime ainzwa cet lugo; dede nnui kangge nnui lungning tsam lacai, Tinggwang cide nnuide keulia beuzie. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Iciuliede, anui ngau kelude, anui cide teu lungh lugo.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Sinamedung, acu reli kelame tei lulo. Nnui ziemne anui puisau teilia kegaide nzui kelamede piesiakte lulo. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Ih ndaa aide nnui dage ma kekie ranglia dida, nah Ih cide a miakdui lwa eh ranggai daila, mina kekiee Khrista cross ngauraume tei lungh la dida. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Penui nli au kengkap, kedanemene penui tinggwang au penui za, nah penui hegie au penui hengam ga la, nah penui kideube gudung cetla. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Dede anui au tinggim peupeime ge dida, cikade anuide kelikelube, Rampaube Jisu Khrista de regui eh kwabam. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Ma pelane pekang gage kaipwa kebam kengkieng de teu eh pa anui pum kemnei dungde tei ntsam pwa pe pum kendu de nzwa tei dizie.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Cine, Ih hung nah regui kela, a sinamedung, a suiyi nah a peurwa, ainzwa eh kehung a zangmedung Rampaube gade sap ntip lulo.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kecungkegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Ih Euodia penai Syntyche de Rampaube gade ngngwa kelungnzwa lulo kie gaila. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Nah kesang a zangbo, mipui aipau kena dede ngha gailo n dade kiela, kedanemene penai samliakeyi kepau ga acu ngngwa heta teigwang kecune, Clement nah mi kedamedung de si eh, penui zi Kering Laisiukwak ga bam.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Rampaube gade nnui suiyi lamui lulo. Ih rang daizie, nnui suiyi lulo. <verse eid="PHP 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Peu mina pelane de nnui zai kenciep de ci lulo. Rampaube cailigwang kera nna dida. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Magede cet pwa nnui lung keherei so, dede makeheibe gade nnui nggia kie nah kekie tei pecu twa eh nnui kie kelabe Tinggwang dage peu cigai lulo. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Iciude Tinggwang lungciep, ma pelane ci kelabe, Khrista Jisu gade nnui mlung nah nnui lungning gum teula luzie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:3">Isa. 26:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Kamtube, sinamedung, kesangbe, rütlu kebuibe, kemzuibe, kemcibe, hezukeyibe, siu keyibe leune, makeheibe de keyibedung bamcai, nah makeheibe de hetwa peulu kebuibe bamcai, ma aidungde cet bam lulo. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Nnui a dade ci nah luukelu nah siu nah ngau kelube tei mzai lulo, iciude Tinggwang lungciepbe nnuida bam luzie.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mapeu de ziemne Paul rangkegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Cu Ih Rampaube gade a sui yisüt bamlie, kedanemene cu peting ketiee ge cai nnui acu helungnei kelade nsungdai kelune. Nnui a mapiela kesang, dede nnui ngha kera peting keyi ngau luma. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Ih aide teu maikesia ne rangbam ma, kedanemene a da kebam de teu Ih mnung lu kera cilu delu. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Ih ma kegah, nah mbaang eh kebam au dainzwabi kecu ci. Kehei gade nah ma pelane gade kenggei nah kemzeu, mede pui kenlim mede teu maisia de ci luda. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Acu teingkieng beu kelabe ziemne Ih ma pelane tei lubui. <verse eid="PHP 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Ciuliede, nnui a reidung ga acu ngha kegai yizu lie. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Nnui Philippime de cibam samliakeyi ndeu kecu dau, Ih Macedonia kahpet dige, nnui gwale ngqwa kedagede makepeu nah luu kecu ta ga acu ngngwa mzi ma, <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Ih Thessalonica namdi ga kebam daude, Ih teu maisia dige piage swade kiee eh nnui kengha acu langgai beu. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Ih mapeu de luuneu kecube ma, dede Ih nnui bata de ziemne kemmi de ngau gaineu lala. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Cu Ih ma pelane pui kenlim ngau luda, nah kieesi de luda. Nnui Epaphroditus dage langgai kebeu mapeude cu Ih ngaulwe acu kepui teibam dida. Cidungde au ratak Tinggwang luulu kebui nah pe suiyilu kebui marim kehengui gelie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:16">Heb. 13:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Cu a Tinggwang pe kendu mahei kebam Khrista Jisu gade nnui teumaikesia leune pwapeu zie. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Peu anui Tinggwang nah Peibe de kelungta nah kelungta ndula kelube tei lulo. Amen.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kelumkegai kekambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Khrista Jisu gade kemcime pelane de kelum gaila. Siname acu ngngwa kelamedung nnuide kelum gaila. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Kemcime pelane nnuide kelum gaila, dede bamkeraide Romme gwangpei Caesar kiga kebammedung. <verse eid="PHP 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Peu Rampaube Jisu Khrista ngaugiabe depeu nnui rabe de ngngwa bam kelube tei lulo. Amen.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>